WEBVTT

00:00:02.080 --> 00:00:06.610
<i>Asu no egao no tame ni!
For the smiles of tomorrow!</i>

00:00:13.590 --> 00:00:16.800
<i>Chikara to chikara butsukareba,
When power collides with power,</i>

00:00:16.800 --> 00:00:19.390
<i>arasoi wa hajimaru.
wars start.</i>

00:00:20.070 --> 00:00:22.940
<i>Tatakau koto ga</i> yuuki <i>to</i>
I <i>don't think fighting</i>

00:00:22.940 --> 00:00:24.940
<i>omowanai kedo...
equals bravery, but...</i>

00:00:24.940 --> 00:00:27.340
<i>...mamoritai yo
...I want to protect</i>

00:00:27.340 --> 00:00:29.900
kimi <i>no sono egao.
that smile on your face.</i>

00:00:32.080 --> 00:00:35.510
<i>Asu e no geeto
We can't see the gate</i>

00:00:35.510 --> 00:00:38.210
<i>mienai keredo...
to tomorrow, but...</i>

00:00:38.580 --> 00:00:41.990
<i>dare ni</i> demo <i>aru yo.
one's inside each of us.</i>

00:00:41.990 --> 00:00:44.650
<i>Let's open the gate!</i>

00:00:46.230 --> 00:00:49.360
Kinou <i>no namida</i> wa
<i>The tears we shed yesterday</i>

00:00:49.360 --> 00:00:51.630
<i>kitto muda ja nai.
are probably not in vain.</i>

00:00:52.130 --> 00:00:56.000
<i>Arasoi no nai</i> mirai wa
<i>A future without war</i>

00:00:56.000 --> 00:00:59.770
<i>ano tobira no mukougawa.
waits behind that door.</i>

00:01:00.140 --> 00:01:02.910
Mune <i>no oku</i> fukaku
<i>Retrieve the key lying</i>

00:01:02.910 --> 00:01:06.850
<i>Jitto shimaikonda
deep inside your heart,</i>

00:01:06.850 --> 00:01:09.650
<i>kagi wo takaku kakagete,
hold it up high,</i>

00:01:09.650 --> 00:01:11.880
<i>fumidasou!
and step out!</i>

00:01:11.880 --> 00:01:16.190
<i>Asu no egao no tame ni!
For the smiles of tomorrow!</i>

00:01:16.760 --> 00:01:22.720
<i>You can open the gate!</i>

00:01:35.960 --> 00:01:37.480
<i>When are you moving away, Rurippe?</i>

00:01:37.510 --> 00:01:39.130
<i>Next week.</i>

00:01:40.280 --> 00:01:41.740
<i>Uh, you know what?</i>

00:01:42.580 --> 00:01:44.140
I...

00:01:44.950 --> 00:01:46.470
<i>Let's go, Shun!</i>

00:01:47.950 --> 00:01:49.390
<i>See you!</i>

00:01:49.450 --> 00:01:51.010
<i>Huh? Wait!</i>

00:01:55.020 --> 00:01:58.020
<i>I have to tell you, Shun...</i>

00:01:58.960 --> 00:02:02.730
<i>I.. always...</i>

00:02:03.200 --> 00:02:05.690
I always liked you!

00:02:13.610 --> 00:02:15.310
<i>I'm sorry, Rurippe.</i>

00:02:17.610 --> 00:02:21.520
<i>Actually. .. I like Miyo.</i>

00:02:21.580 --> 00:02:24.820
<i>She doesn't have a...</i>

00:02:24.890 --> 00:02:26.980
<i>...a runny nose like you.</i>

00:02:27.890 --> 00:02:29.420
<i>Nose?</i>

00:02:32.360 --> 00:02:35.200
<i>N... N...</i>

00:02:35.270 --> 00:02:37.460
<i>NOOOOOO!!!</i>

00:02:58.220 --> 00:03:01.950
Of all people, why does
HE have to be a gate keeper?!

00:03:10.330 --> 00:03:13.200
Good, good. We're hosting
the World Exposition next year...

00:03:13.270 --> 00:03:15.240
...and the boom in
prosperity should continue.

00:03:16.740 --> 00:03:18.610
Good morning.

00:03:18.680 --> 00:03:21.580
Morning. What's this?
You look a little pale.

00:03:21.980 --> 00:03:23.810
It's nothing, I'm okay.

00:03:24.250 --> 00:03:29.080
You're such a hard worker that your
mother worries about you sometimes.

00:03:30.990 --> 00:03:34.360
You're forgetting to call
yourself Mama" or "Mommy?

00:03:34.420 --> 00:03:35.890
Yes, darling.

00:03:38.590 --> 00:03:40.930
Oh! I have to go!

00:03:41.000 --> 00:03:42.930
It's not even 8 o'clock yet.

00:03:43.000 --> 00:03:46.330
The teacher asked me to show
a transfer student around.

00:03:46.700 --> 00:03:48.260
Bye. Dad!

00:03:48.340 --> 00:03:51.330
You forgot again!
I'm " Papa!" or...

00:03:51.410 --> 00:03:53.380
Or " Pappy," right?

00:03:58.850 --> 00:04:01.610
<i>Transfer student, 'huh?</i>

00:04:02.520 --> 00:04:03.950
Thanks for breakfast, Mom!

00:04:04.020 --> 00:04:05.990
Oh,yeah! I'm going
to be late home today!

00:04:06.060 --> 00:04:07.490
Why?

00:04:07.560 --> 00:04:08.990
Uh, I...

00:04:09.060 --> 00:04:12.590
...was asked to stand in on a
practice game for the kendo team.

00:04:12.660 --> 00:04:14.960
I'm going to a school downtown.

00:04:15.030 --> 00:04:17.400
You...! But we're all
going to Shinjuku today!

00:04:17.470 --> 00:04:19.060
N- Now that you mention it...

00:04:19.140 --> 00:04:22.160
We're going to shop for your
new shoes and eat omelet-rice...

00:04:22.240 --> 00:04:25.040
...at the department store. They're
having a folk song festival, too!

00:04:25.110 --> 00:04:28.370
All right, I'll keep my word.

00:04:28.440 --> 00:04:29.910
Bye!

00:04:31.750 --> 00:04:33.680
Hmph! I'm not a cat!

00:04:38.920 --> 00:04:44.020
So, where is the secret base
for the AEGIS Earth Defense Army?

00:04:44.090 --> 00:04:46.990
It's not an army!
It's an organization!

00:04:47.060 --> 00:04:48.360
Same thing.

00:04:48.430 --> 00:04:50.370
Good afternoon!

00:04:50.430 --> 00:04:52.400
Would you like blend or regular?

00:04:54.470 --> 00:04:55.940
I'll take the special.

00:04:57.170 --> 00:04:58.640
Roger, AEGIS!

00:05:03.480 --> 00:05:05.610
Hey, Dad! A car
turned into a mole!

00:05:05.680 --> 00:05:08.120
Yeah, I remember. On TV
last night. It sure was neat.

00:05:08.180 --> 00:05:09.650
No, not that! For real!

00:05:10.590 --> 00:05:14.990
We first confirmed their
existence around 1945.

00:05:15.530 --> 00:05:18.690
It was just when
World War ll was ending.

00:05:23.500 --> 00:05:25.990
They blended in
with human society...

00:05:26.070 --> 00:05:29.660
...and undertook various subversive
activities around the world.

00:05:35.480 --> 00:05:38.470
Holy cow! A YS this far underground!

00:05:38.550 --> 00:05:41.350
Hey, that thing has rockets on it!

00:05:46.560 --> 00:05:48.260
- Our organization... To imagine that you
guys built a place like this under Tokyo!

00:05:48.260 --> 00:05:50.420
To imagine that you guys built
a place like this under Tokyo!

00:05:50.490 --> 00:05:53.390
Man, it surprised the
living Jesus out of me!

00:05:57.530 --> 00:05:58.800
Wow!!

00:05:58.870 --> 00:06:01.700
In order to thwart the invasion,
the Earth Defense Organization...

00:06:01.770 --> 00:06:04.600
...AEGIS was established with
worldwide financial cooperation.

00:06:04.670 --> 00:06:08.240
It is best referred to as
'a shield for mankind.'

00:06:18.520 --> 00:06:20.990
And this, Shun Ukiya!

00:06:21.060 --> 00:06:24.430
Wow!! This is a computer, right?!
These can calculate anything, right?!

00:06:24.490 --> 00:06:25.980
Ukiya!

00:06:26.460 --> 00:06:27.930
Yes?

00:06:28.630 --> 00:06:32.030
To combat invaders unbeatable
by conventional weaponry...

00:06:32.100 --> 00:06:35.130
...we need people able
to open the gates...

00:06:35.200 --> 00:06:38.540
...which call forth enormous
energy from other dimensions!

00:06:45.580 --> 00:06:49.070
We want you in the
Gate Keeper team!

00:06:49.850 --> 00:06:53.450
We need your ability
as a gate keeper!

00:07:01.900 --> 00:07:06.130
I didn't expect you to ask
for time to think it over.

00:07:06.200 --> 00:07:09.830
You were so excited, I thought
you would accept immediately.

00:07:09.910 --> 00:07:11.530
Yeah. But you know, Rurip...

00:07:11.610 --> 00:07:12.840
There!

00:07:13.080 --> 00:07:14.840
SCIENCE ROOM

00:07:19.580 --> 00:07:21.880
I'm about to show you
around the school...

00:07:21.950 --> 00:07:25.150
...but you have to promise
to stop calling me Rurippe!

00:07:25.220 --> 00:07:26.480
Why?

00:07:26.560 --> 00:07:28.520
I'm different than before.

00:07:30.860 --> 00:07:33.120
Is this the school?
That's right.

00:07:33.200 --> 00:07:37.000
The Far Eastern branch of AEGIS was
built directly beneath the school.

00:07:38.970 --> 00:07:40.600
So this is where you come out!

00:07:40.670 --> 00:07:43.610
We're going.
Hey, wait for me, Rurip...

00:07:45.310 --> 00:07:47.280
Miss Ruriko...

00:07:48.340 --> 00:07:51.780
Th- This place sparkles in
every corner, doesn't it.

00:07:51.850 --> 00:07:54.210
Not like my rundown
dump of a school.

00:07:56.390 --> 00:07:58.410
- Get that, will you?
- Okay!

00:07:58.490 --> 00:08:00.550
The girls are all pretty, too!

00:08:00.620 --> 00:08:02.820
Oh, lkusawa!

00:08:02.890 --> 00:08:04.190
Thank goodness you're here!

00:08:04.260 --> 00:08:08.220
Without you, the Student Council
meeting was horrible today!

00:08:08.300 --> 00:08:09.230
What happened?

00:08:09.300 --> 00:08:13.200
Those boys started making trouble
with a rabble-rousing speech.

00:08:13.270 --> 00:08:17.210
All right, I'll try to talk
with them. More importantly...

00:08:17.270 --> 00:08:21.180
...be careful other class committee
members aren't dragged into it.

00:08:21.240 --> 00:08:22.710
You're so smart, lkusawa.

00:08:22.780 --> 00:08:24.870
Setting that aside,
who's that boy?

00:08:27.280 --> 00:08:28.840
H- He's a transfer student.

00:08:28.920 --> 00:08:31.910
I was just showing him around
because the teacher asked me.

00:08:32.690 --> 00:08:36.250
Even the teachers have
faith in you, lkusawa.

00:08:36.330 --> 00:08:38.230
N... No, they don't...

00:08:38.290 --> 00:08:39.890
Thanks!
Bye!

00:08:43.700 --> 00:08:46.190
See what I mean by
different from before?

00:08:46.270 --> 00:08:47.740
You've definitely changed, all right.

00:08:47.800 --> 00:08:49.240
See?

00:08:49.310 --> 00:08:51.570
Before, you didn't try
so hard to be perfect.

00:08:52.310 --> 00:08:53.900
No, never mind!

00:08:55.380 --> 00:08:57.180
We're doing muscle training today.

00:08:57.250 --> 00:08:59.940
Well, I'm going now.
I have a promise to keep.

00:09:00.020 --> 00:09:02.250
- So, what have you decided?
- About what?

00:09:02.890 --> 00:09:04.910
About joining the Gate Keeper team.

00:09:04.990 --> 00:09:06.820
Oh, yeah...

00:09:06.890 --> 00:09:10.480
lf l join up, I'll have to
transfer to this school, right?

00:09:11.330 --> 00:09:15.530
There's no worry about commuting.
You'd be living in the dorm nearby.

00:09:16.370 --> 00:09:18.490
So l can't commute from home.

00:09:18.730 --> 00:09:21.900
Out of the question. I live
nearby, so it's okay for me...

00:09:21.970 --> 00:09:24.940
...but you never know when an
emergency summons could come.

00:09:25.010 --> 00:09:29.540
It looks like fun to defend the Earth,
but I don't know about transferring.

00:09:29.610 --> 00:09:32.310
Looks like fun?! How can
you think it's fun?!

00:09:33.420 --> 00:09:35.380
What's with you all of a sudden?

00:09:35.450 --> 00:09:37.680
Ukiya, don't get
full of yourself...

00:09:37.750 --> 00:09:40.250
...just because you defeated
the enemy in that last fight!

00:09:40.720 --> 00:09:43.690
That's called a fluke!
Do you understand?

00:09:44.960 --> 00:09:48.290
You're just bent about
me stealing your glory.

00:09:48.360 --> 00:09:49.920
It's not that! I...

00:09:50.000 --> 00:09:52.330
It's not like l can help it.

00:09:52.400 --> 00:09:55.700
My gate power is
just too incredible.

00:09:55.770 --> 00:10:00.270
Don't get the wrong idea!
Gates aren't that easy to master!

00:10:00.740 --> 00:10:02.970
Don't act superior with me!

00:10:03.050 --> 00:10:05.670
- I'm advising!
-You're Advertising!

00:10:06.720 --> 00:10:08.510
G- Good morning, Kurogane.

00:10:10.050 --> 00:10:12.020
A lover's quarrel?

00:10:12.090 --> 00:10:13.720
Excellent.

00:10:16.460 --> 00:10:19.690
As we were discussing
a moment ago, Ukiya!

00:10:23.730 --> 00:10:25.900
You ran away, didn't you!!!

00:10:29.910 --> 00:10:38.850
STUPID BIG BROTHER!

00:10:39.350 --> 00:10:42.010
<i>I broke my word</i>

00:10:43.090 --> 00:10:44.810
<i>But you promised.</i>

00:10:44.890 --> 00:10:46.380
<i>Liar!</i>

00:10:46.460 --> 00:10:48.420
<i>Stupid Dad'</i>

00:10:51.490 --> 00:10:53.120
Stupid, huh?

00:10:54.930 --> 00:10:58.090
I did the same thing as you.

00:11:07.280 --> 00:11:10.710
War's bad, adults are more bad...

00:11:13.180 --> 00:11:14.910
ls this sort of thing interesting?

00:11:14.980 --> 00:11:18.220
Who cares?! Later, I'm going to
gloat about it to big brother!

00:11:20.460 --> 00:11:25.660
You're just using this antiwar
garbage as an excuse to stand out.

00:11:26.460 --> 00:11:29.060
If you really wanna stand out,
sing something like this!

00:11:29.130 --> 00:11:32.400
War, banzai! Go-Go-Go!
Peace, go to hell! Go-Go-Go!

00:11:32.470 --> 00:11:34.270
Bang, bang! You're dead!
Boom, boom!!

00:11:34.340 --> 00:11:37.000
Horrible!
I don't want to be an adult!

00:11:37.240 --> 00:11:38.760
Nailed it.

00:11:46.250 --> 00:11:48.840
Idiot! What did you do to my guitar?!

00:11:58.060 --> 00:11:59.720
Commencing action.

00:12:16.280 --> 00:12:18.250
Paranormal frequencies registered!

00:12:21.950 --> 00:12:23.850
We've registered paranormal
frequencies, you say?

00:12:23.920 --> 00:12:28.520
Yes, at Point N860, E-O15, near
the west exit of Shinjuku station.

00:12:28.590 --> 00:12:30.460
What are they after?!

00:12:30.530 --> 00:12:33.000
An anti-war folk song festival
is currently being held...

00:12:33.060 --> 00:12:36.900
...at Shinjuku's west exit.
Many youths are present.

00:12:36.970 --> 00:12:38.430
Do you suppose?

00:12:39.900 --> 00:12:44.030
I have it! They're after youths who
will bring our planet a bright future!

00:12:45.210 --> 00:12:49.170
Ms. Ochiai! Tell lkusawa
to head out immediately!

00:12:49.650 --> 00:12:51.910
R- Roger, AEGIS!

00:13:05.960 --> 00:13:08.930
Stupid dad

00:13:09.000 --> 00:13:10.690
It's completely rusted.

00:13:19.010 --> 00:13:21.310
<i>Hey, we still have this.</i>

00:13:23.010 --> 00:13:26.000
<i>What'll I do, Dad?</i>
I dropped it...

00:13:27.650 --> 00:13:30.480
<i>0h, the main wing is broken, huh?</i>

00:13:30.550 --> 00:13:32.750
<i>It's all right. I'll
have it fixed by tomorrow.</i>

00:13:33.990 --> 00:13:38.290
<i>Really? I promised my friends we'd
go flying in the vacant lot on Sunday.</i>

00:13:38.360 --> 00:13:41.090
<i>Go!</i>
<i>It's a new world record!</i>

00:13:41.800 --> 00:13:43.600
<i>Sorry, I wasn 't able
to get away from this.</i>

00:13:46.870 --> 00:13:48.600
<i>Stupid Dad“</i>

00:13:51.370 --> 00:13:55.940
<i>Give me a chance!</i> It'll <i>work
out with the engine I thought up.</i>

00:13:56.010 --> 00:13:59.110
<i>Twin cams and rotaries won 't
stand a chance against it.</i>

00:14:00.020 --> 00:14:01.510
ELEMENTARY SCHOOL
GRADUATION CEREMONY

00:14:02.590 --> 00:14:06.020
<i>Your mother is in the hospital,
so I'll come for you, I promise.</i>

00:14:06.990 --> 00:14:11.290
<i>Forget it. You never
keep your word</i>

00:14:11.360 --> 00:14:13.060
<i>This time I'm not lying</i>

00:14:13.130 --> 00:14:16.060
<i>I'll come racing for you
in my fabulous car!</i>

00:14:16.130 --> 00:14:17.220
<i>You finished it?</i>

00:14:17.300 --> 00:14:21.000
<i>Yeah. We'll take it for a test drive
after your graduation ceremony!</i>

00:14:30.010 --> 00:14:31.640
<i>Dad, you liar.</i>

00:14:59.380 --> 00:15:01.340
Somebody! ls anybody there?

00:15:02.140 --> 00:15:03.310
Are you all right?

00:15:03.380 --> 00:15:06.010
People are hurt!
Do something, quick!

00:15:07.080 --> 00:15:09.570
Just a little longer!
Hold on just a little longer!

00:15:10.090 --> 00:15:11.950
<i>I'll get</i> help!

00:15:12.020 --> 00:15:14.720
It's all right.
Help will arrive soon.

00:15:15.120 --> 00:15:16.590
Don't worry!

00:15:21.630 --> 00:15:23.100
Invaders!

00:15:36.710 --> 00:15:41.150
GATE OPEN!

00:15:42.120 --> 00:15:43.590
Arrow of light!

00:15:47.790 --> 00:15:50.350
<i>It defended itself
with wind pressure?!</i>

00:15:55.800 --> 00:15:58.960
It's no good.
If I leave home now...

00:15:59.030 --> 00:16:01.160
...l'll be just the same as Dad.

00:16:01.240 --> 00:16:04.640
I'd be wrapped up in my hobbies
without caring about my family...

00:16:04.710 --> 00:16:06.200
...just like Dad.

00:16:12.880 --> 00:16:15.080
Hey, it's you, Shun.

00:16:15.150 --> 00:16:16.710
You bought a new car!

00:16:16.790 --> 00:16:19.810
New cars sure are great.
Wanta ride?

00:16:20.460 --> 00:16:23.080
I liked your old three-
wheeler, too, though...

00:16:23.160 --> 00:16:25.060
<i>This is breaking news.</i>

00:16:25.130 --> 00:16:28.330
<i>Due to the explosion at the
west exit of Shinjuku Station...</i>

00:16:28.330 --> 00:16:29.200
STUPID BIG BROTHER

00:16:29.470 --> 00:16:31.430
What?! At Shinjuku?!

00:16:39.170 --> 00:16:40.700
I'm not through yet!

00:16:42.410 --> 00:16:43.940
I can't be beaten!

00:16:51.490 --> 00:16:53.790
<i>That's right, Ruriko!
You can do it'!</i>

00:16:55.260 --> 00:16:58.160
<i>You've undergone
intensive training for this!</i>

00:16:58.230 --> 00:16:59.700
You can do it!!

00:17:01.200 --> 00:17:02.660
The roof!

00:17:05.170 --> 00:17:06.730
Three left!

00:17:10.840 --> 00:17:12.330
I did it!

00:17:18.250 --> 00:17:23.240
I'm no longer the runny-nosed
Rurippe you knew, Ukiya!

00:17:24.520 --> 00:17:26.490
Can't you go any faster?

00:17:26.560 --> 00:17:28.850
I can't. I haven't finished
breaking her in yet.

00:17:31.130 --> 00:17:33.530
<i>Hold on, Saemi Mom!</i>

00:17:50.250 --> 00:17:52.180
Commander! I've spotted
an unidentified vehicle...

00:17:52.250 --> 00:17:54.550
...heading for Shinjuku at
a speed of 300km per hour!

00:17:55.250 --> 00:17:56.810
<i>It's too dangerous!</i>

00:17:56.890 --> 00:17:59.120
Could it be...?

00:17:59.190 --> 00:18:02.210
Ms. Ochiai, turn all the traffic
signals green for the vehicle!

00:18:02.290 --> 00:18:03.820
Roger!

00:18:14.070 --> 00:18:16.630
You can do it. You can do it!
You can do it, Ruriko!

00:18:17.970 --> 00:18:20.410
Registering dangerous
energy reaction.

00:18:22.950 --> 00:18:24.910
Saemi!! Mom!!

00:18:24.980 --> 00:18:26.450
Ukiya!

00:18:27.880 --> 00:18:29.350
Saemi! Mom!

00:18:30.320 --> 00:18:31.750
H- Help us...

00:18:31.820 --> 00:18:33.250
ls backup here yet?

00:18:33.320 --> 00:18:34.920
It's breaking apart more...

00:18:35.190 --> 00:18:36.820
Saemi! ls that you, Saemi?

00:18:38.290 --> 00:18:39.760
Ukiya!

00:18:40.330 --> 00:18:41.800
Ukiya...

00:18:44.330 --> 00:18:45.890
Why, you!!

00:18:46.900 --> 00:18:48.530
OUT OF MY WAY!

00:18:49.640 --> 00:18:51.400
Stop it! Stop it now!

00:18:51.740 --> 00:18:53.710
No! It's still alive!

00:18:53.980 --> 00:18:55.440
Stupid!

00:19:01.980 --> 00:19:04.610
Are you trying to kill the
people trapped in here, too?!

00:19:05.350 --> 00:19:06.950
But, I...

00:19:07.020 --> 00:19:10.580
lf you use the power of the gate
incorrectly, you can kill people!

00:19:11.930 --> 00:19:13.330
But I

00:19:13.400 --> 00:19:16.590
I only wanted to protect
my Mom and Saemi...

00:19:16.670 --> 00:19:18.630
...in my father's place.

00:19:18.830 --> 00:19:20.460
Stand up! Quick!

00:19:22.000 --> 00:19:24.940
Did that slap hurt?
I bet it did!

00:19:25.010 --> 00:19:26.600
It hurts because you're
alive to feel it!

00:19:26.680 --> 00:19:28.610
If you die, you
can't feel anything...

00:19:28.680 --> 00:19:31.370
...and you can't save
your loved ones, stupid!

00:19:34.750 --> 00:19:36.380
<i>Stupid big brother!</i>

00:19:39.350 --> 00:19:40.840
<i>Liar!</i>

00:19:43.690 --> 00:19:46.630
I... I'm not a liar!

00:19:47.030 --> 00:19:50.360
I won't die without making up for
breaking my word. I'm not like Dad!

00:19:52.070 --> 00:19:53.970
GATE...

00:19:54.040 --> 00:19:56.000
...OPEN!

00:20:28.070 --> 00:20:30.370
It's all right now! Relax!

00:20:31.070 --> 00:20:32.600
Mom! Saemi!

00:20:32.670 --> 00:20:34.010
Big brother?!

00:20:34.080 --> 00:20:36.010
Stupid, stupid!
Stupid big brother!

00:20:36.080 --> 00:20:39.070
We almost got
buried alive in here!

00:20:39.150 --> 00:20:41.120
I'm sorry l was late.

00:20:43.350 --> 00:20:44.510
B..

00:20:44.590 --> 00:20:46.210
Big brothefl!

00:20:48.120 --> 00:20:49.350
Mom...

00:20:49.420 --> 00:20:51.390
Come on. We're all together now...

00:20:51.460 --> 00:20:54.450
...so let's have supper at the
department store and go home.

00:20:54.530 --> 00:20:57.790
I want the Kids Meal!
What about you, big brother?

00:20:57.870 --> 00:20:58.700
Me, too!

00:20:58.770 --> 00:21:01.600
What?! Yeesh, you never grow up!

00:21:02.740 --> 00:21:05.040
Stop that!
I told you I'm not a cat!!

00:21:06.780 --> 00:21:08.570
It has to be a lie!

00:21:09.110 --> 00:21:13.070
I can't believe a school wants
you as a kendo honor student!

00:21:16.550 --> 00:21:17.680
All right.

00:21:17.750 --> 00:21:19.080
Mom?!

00:21:19.150 --> 00:21:21.120
You made up your own mind.

00:21:21.190 --> 00:21:24.820
Besides, though you'll be in
a dorm, it's still in Tokyo.

00:21:25.490 --> 00:21:27.050
I'm sorry, Mom.

00:21:27.130 --> 00:21:29.390
It can't be! It can't be!
It can't be!

00:21:29.460 --> 00:21:33.060
But you're unreliable,
I had to be strong!

00:21:33.470 --> 00:21:38.910
If you go away, I'll be
forced to be even stronger!

00:21:41.340 --> 00:21:42.870
Don't say that...

00:21:42.940 --> 00:21:45.240
Fine! I'm not a cat!

00:21:52.920 --> 00:21:54.890
Well, see you later!

00:22:07.410 --> 00:22:11.110
<i>Itsumademo wasurenai
We received many things</i>

00:22:11.110 --> 00:22:14.980
<i>takusan no mono moratta ne.
we will never forget.</i>

00:22:15.080 --> 00:22:19.950
<i>Sora no iro utsushite hikaru
I don't mean the blue jewels flashing</i>

00:22:20.490 --> 00:22:23.330
<i>aoi houseki ya
with colors of the sky...</i>

00:22:23.330 --> 00:22:25.460
koinu-tachi
or a big yard

00:22:25.460 --> 00:22:30.630
<i>hanemawaru hiroi</i> niwaja <i>nai,
with puppies romping around,</i>

00:22:30.630 --> 00:22:33.970
motto motto daijina
but something <i>much</i> more

00:22:33.970 --> 00:22:38.600
<i>mono wo.
important.</i>

00:22:39.310 --> 00:22:43.470
<i>Kinou Kara kyou e
From yesterday to today,</i>

00:22:43.550 --> 00:22:48.110
<i>kyou kara asu e to
from today to tomorrow,</i>

00:22:48.580 --> 00:22:54.890
boku-tachi wa aruite yuku yo.
we will walk toward the future.
